        <name>AI Council Assessment</name>
        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The U.S. Navy has conducted a series of military operations, including missile launches and aircraft deployments. The U.S. is developing new missile warning systems and is equipping its ships with advanced combat systems. Ukraine has demonstrated its military capabilities with the use of domestically developed missiles, and the U.S. is focusing on autonomous and robotic capabilities in its new combatant command. The U.S. is also testing a decoupled nuclear detonation and acquiring new long-range strike missiles for its allies. The Montana Air National Guard&#39;s C-130H Hercules aircraft is retiring, while the 104th Fighter Wing&#39;s Norwegian Foot March celebrates Command Senior Enlisted Leader retirement. The Idaho Air National Guard&#39;s fire protection specialists are visiting Cambodia, and the 94th Army Air and Missile Defense Command hosts a simulation exercise.</description>
